{"displayStem":"같은 길이의 허혈 뒤 두 조직에 혈류를 재개하였다. X는 미토콘드리아 투과성 전이 억제 조건으로 설계되었고 관류·산소 유입은 두 군에서 동일하다. 임상 약물의 효능 시험은 아닌 교육 모형이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C08 c08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>재관류 60min 지표</th><th>대조</th><th>X</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>조직 혈류 (허혈 전 대비 %)</td><td>100</td><td>101</td></tr><tr><td>산화 스트레스 표지 (상대값)</td><td>3</td><td>1.4</td></tr><tr><td>막 손상 표지 방출 (전체 대비 %)</td><td>48</td><td>17</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C08 c08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><figure class=\"c08-panel\"><figcaption>재관류 뒤 ATP</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"재관류 뒤 ATP: 재관류 후 (min), ATP (대조 대비 %)\"><rect width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><path d=\"M76 50V235H526\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"18\" y=\"27\">ATP (대조 대비 %)</text><path d=\"M76 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"76\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M186 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"186\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><path d=\"M296 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"296\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><path d=\"M406 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"406\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><path d=\"M516 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"516\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M71 235h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M71 191.25h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"197.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><path d=\"M71 147.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"153.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">60</text><path d=\"M71 103.75h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"109.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">90</text><path d=\"M71 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"end\">120</text><polyline points=\"76,213.125 186,191.25 296,185.41666666666666 516,183.95833333333334\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"213.125\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"191.25\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"185.41666666666666\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"183.95833333333334\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><path d=\"M85 320h28\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path><text x=\"120\" y=\"326\">대조</text><polyline points=\"76,213.125 186,147.5 296,118.33333333333333 516,102.29166666666666\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"></polyline><rect x=\"73.5\" y=\"210.625\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"183.5\" y=\"145\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"293.5\" y=\"115.83333333333333\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"513.5\" y=\"99.79166666666666\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><path d=\"M325 320h28\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"></path><text x=\"360\" y=\"326\">X</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">재관류 후 (min)</text></svg></figure></div></div>"]}